  "description": "The AIR Belgie is Curve's top-level road frameset, combining the stiffness of carbon with the comfort of titanium. At its core is a 3Al-2.5V Grade 9 aerospace-grade titanium tubeset, chosen for its balance of stiffness, compliance and durability.\nThe standout feature is the 3D-printed bottom bracket assembly: a phenomenally strong double-lap carbon-titanium bond that delivers a real leap forward in stiffness and power transfer, not just a styling exercise.\nEvery AIR Belgie frame is bonded and finished by hand in Curve's Melbourne workshop, with artwork and cosmetic finishing completed in-house using high-end by Candy Factory Paintworks. This bundle includes the frame, fork, seatpost and headset. Ready for you to build your own complete AIR Belgie with the groupset, wheels and finishing kit of your choice.",
